meta {
  name: 14-Save my favourite listing
  type: http
  seq: 14
}

post {
  url: {{host}}/api/listings/1/save
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{temi_token}}
}

assert {
  res.status: in [204, 401, 404]
}

docs {
  Bookmarking the listing I liked yesterday so I can come back to
  it. Spec says this is idempotent — saving twice doesn't error.

  No request body even though the docs talk about pinning a
  reason — it's just POST with no body, the listing ID in the URL
  identifies what I'm saving. Fine, simple.
}
